<p id="A2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">After SFT, we further optimize the model with reinforcement learning to improve reliable tool use and multi-step spatial reasoning.
Table <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ RL training parameters. ‣ B.1 Training and Inference ‣ Appendix B Implementation Details ‣ Perceive, Interact, Reason: Building Tool-Augmented Visual Agents for Spatial Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> reports the shared RL training and rollout settings, together with the algorithm-specific parameters used by OR-GIGPO and DAPO.</p>
