</figure>
</section>
<section id="A6.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.3 </span>Map-oriented Tools and Map/Non-map Balance</h3>

<div id="A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluated the trained checkpoint with both <span id="A6.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">map_text_ocr</span> and <span id="A6.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">draw_path</span> removed at inference time on the complete test sets of ReasonMap-Plus, ReasonMap, and MapTrace. This is a full-test-set diagnostic for these three map benchmarks only. As shown in Table <a href="#A6.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ F.3 Map-oriented Tools and Map/Non-map Balance ‣ Appendix F Fine-grained Tool-use Analysis ‣ Perceive, Interact, Reason: Building Tool-Augmented Visual Agents for Spatial Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, the restricted model remains above the backbone on all three tasks.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.T13" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A6.T13.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A6.T13.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
